          "name",
          "type"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "description": "The current deployment uses two namespace aliases \u2013 **sys** maps to the **System** namespace and **net** maps to **Network** \u2013 and applies two sets of default parameters across all components. Every connection defaults to the MQTT protocol on port\u202f1883, while logging is configured at the **info** level and directed to **stdout**.  \n\nTwo device groups are defined. The **FactoryFloor** group contains the sensor\u202f*sensor\u2011001* (secret **s3cr3tA1**) and the actuator\u202f*actuator\u2011007* (secret **s3cr3tB2**). It runs a **TemperatureMonitoring** job every\u202f5\u202fminutes, sourcing data through a *TempSensorFilter* (type **sensor**, unit **Celsius**), then applying an *AnomalyDetection* filter (type **ml**, model **anomaly_v1**) followed by a *NoiseReduction* filter (type **signal**, method **kalman**) before storing results with a *DatabaseSink* (type **database**, connection string \u201cServer=db;Database=metrics;\u201d). The same group also runs an **ActuatorControl** job every\u202f1\u202fminute, pulling commands from a *CommandSource* (type **mqtt**, topic **factory/commands**), validating them via a *ValidationFilter* (type **logic**, schema **commandSchema**), and finally delivering the commands to an *ActuatorSink* (type **actuator**, mode **auto**).  \n\nThe **RemoteSite** group comprises the camera\u202f*camera\u201112* (secret **camSecret12**) and the gateway\u202f*gateway\u20115* (secret **gateSecret5**). It operates a **VideoStream** job on a 30\u2011second interval, capturing footage with a *VideoCapture* filter (type **camera**, resolution **1080p**), compressing it using a *Compression* filter (type **codec**, codec **h264**, bitrate **4Mbps**), and uploading the stream to a *CloudSink* (type **cloud**, bucket **video-archive**, region **eu\u2011west\u20111**).",
  "reference_json": {
    "globalSettings": {
      "namespaceAliases": [
        {
          "alias": "sys",
          "namespace": "System"
        },
        {
          "alias": "net",
          "namespace": "Network"
        }
      ],
      "defaultParameters": [
        {
          "type": "connection",
          "parameters": {
            "protocol": "MQTT",
            "port": 1883
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "logging",
          "parameters": {
            "level": "info",
            "output": "stdout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "deviceGroups": [
      {
        "name": "FactoryFloor",
        "devices": [
          {
            "deviceId": "sensor-001",
            "deviceSecret": "s3cr3tA1"
          },
          {
            "deviceId": "actuator-007",
            "deviceSecret": "s3cr3tB2"
          }
        ],
        "jobs": [
          {
            "name": "TemperatureMonitoring",
            "interval": "5m",
            "sourceFilter": {
              "name": "TempSensorFilter",
              "type": "sensor",
              "parameters": {
                "unit": "Celsius"
              }
            },
            "intermediaFilters": [
              {
                "name": "AnomalyDetection",
                "type": "ml",
                "parameters": {
                  "model": "anomaly_v1"
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "NoiseReduction",
                "type": "signal",
                "parameters": {
                  "method": "kalman"
                }
              }
            ],
            "sinkFilter": {
              "name": "DatabaseSink",
              "type": "database",
              "parameters": {
                "connectionString": "Server=db;Database=metrics;"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "ActuatorControl",
            "interval": "1m",
            "sourceFilter": {
              "name": "CommandSource",
              "type": "mqtt",
              "parameters": {
                "topic": "factory/commands"
              }
            },
            "intermediaFilters": [
              {
                "name": "ValidationFilter",
                "type": "logic",
                "parameters": {
                  "schema": "commandSchema"
                }
              }
            ],
            "sinkFilter": {
              "name": "ActuatorSink",
              "type": "actuator",
              "parameters": {
                "mode": "auto"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "RemoteSite",
        "devices": [
          {
            "deviceId": "camera-12",
            "deviceSecret": "camSecret12"
          },
          {
            "deviceId": "gateway-5",
            "deviceSecret": "gateSecret5"
          }
        ],
        "jobs": [
          {
            "name": "VideoStream",
            "interval": "30s",
            "sourceFilter": {
              "name": "VideoCapture",
              "type": "camera",
              "parameters": {
                "resolution": "1080p"
              }
            },
            "intermediaFilters": [
              {
                "name": "Compression",
                "type": "codec",
                "parameters": {
                  "codec": "h264",
                  "bitrate": "4Mbps"
                }
              }
            ],
            "sinkFilter": {
              "name": "CloudSink",
              "type": "cloud",
              "parameters": {
                "bucket": "video-archive",
                "region": "eu-west-1"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}